// Page-classification declaration (T1-PAGE-CLASSIFICATION-MODEL, journey_body above) --
// NOT the same word as _AUTH (`auth key`/`auth bearer`/... inside miohttp_body/mioconnect,
// a 4-char prefix that cannot match "authorize" -- the negative lookahead requires a
// non-word char immediately after "auth", but "authorize" continues with "orize"). Collision
